witurnu ngaapirinypa-rna watjaltjaku,","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"‘Kuwarrinya ngamurringu Mama Kuurrtu-lanya","poem":1},{"text":"ngarltunytjulu wankarura kanyiratjaku,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"puru yanyan-yanyanpa nyinapayinya-tjananya ngaparrtjika pungkutjaku.’","poem":2},{"text":"Yuwa, Mama Kuurrtu-rni witurnu pukurlmara-tjananya kanyiratjaku","poem":1},{"text":"nyarra tjirturu-tjirturu-ya nyinarranytjanya.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"Nyangka-tjananyarna walykumunura kanyinma","poem":1},{"text":"nyarra Tjurutjamala tjuni kartalypa-ya nyinarranytjanya.","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nyangka-yayi pukurlpa nyinama.","poem":2},{"text":"Yulatjanu-yulatjanulu-yayi turlku yinkarra Mama Kuurrnga marninypungama.","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Tjiinya-yayi warta witu-witupirinypa nyinama,","poem":1},{"text":"tjiinya Mama Kuurrtu murrutjunu wantitjanya.","poem":2},{"text":"Nyangka-yayi tjukarurrulu palyanma.","poem":1},{"text":"Nyangka-ya yarnangu pirnilu nyakulalpi Mama Kuurrnga marninypungama.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"Palunyangka-ya yiwarla purlkanya pirninya marlakulu palyalku,","poem":1},{"text":"nyarra kutjulpirtu-ya yurntura punkatjingarayirnu wantitjanya.”","poem":2},"Yuwa, palunya."]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/ntj_bsa/ISA/61.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/ntj_bsa/JER/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/ntj_bsa/ISA/60.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":4}